<title>POLAND: POLISH GAS FIRM AGA SELLS 40 MLN OF CPS.</title>
<headline>POLISH GAS FIRM AGA SELLS 40 MLN OF CPS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Polish unit of Swedish industrial gas company AGA AB, Aga Gaz, on Tuesday sold 40 million zlotys of one-month commercial papers with 18.4 percent yields, the issue's agent ING Warsaw said in a statement.</p>
<p>The tranche is part of the company's 40 million zloty borrowing programme launched in February 1995.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
